 later the same way.

### 3.4 Model recipes and the block library

A model is a **recipe** (TOML) over the block library:

```toml
[arch]
name = "qwen3.5"
layers = 64
hidden = 2048
kv_heads = 2
head_dim = 256
attn = "gated_delta_net"        # block type
ffn = "moe"
moe = { experts = 256, top_k = 8, routed = 1024, shared = 1024 }
quant = "exl3"                  # or "nvfp4", "mxfp4", "fp8", "bf16", "gguf:q4_k_m"
tp = 1

[blocks]
gated_delta_net = { kernel = "gdn_decode", state = "recurrent" }
moe = { gate = "topk", experts = "grouped_gemm", shared = "dense" }
```

